Include Directory for the Midi66 library
Chris Ahlstrom
2024-04-28 to 2026-11-17

Unlike the other "66" library projects, the "build macros" header file is
nested in a sub-directory ("include/").

Also note the midi66-config.h.in file, which gets parsed by Meson to create

    midi66-config.h

